وَهَدَيْنَاهُ النَّجْدَيْنِ

فَلا اقْتَحَمَ الْعَقَبَةَ<note>(90:11) The last folio is the other way around (194r-194v).</note>
                     </explicit>
                     <note>Sura headings, long a-vowels, taǧwīd. Vocalized. Some of the words are divided into two different lines.The first folio is upside down (1r-1v); the text begins in the middle of verse 29:7 in 2r</note>
